  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "く……っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "止まった……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It stopped...!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、きっと攻撃の機会をうかがってるのよ。\n卑怯なヤツ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, it's just waiting for a chance to strike. The coward...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "海中の敵を攻撃できるよう、\n船底に武器を取り付けています、それを使えば……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We installed weapons on the ship's hull to attack underwater enemies. If we use those...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もうすでにその武器も起動してる。\nでも、あまり効いてないみたいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those weapons are already active. But they don't seem to be doing much damage."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Captain"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすが頂獣。何もかも計算通りってわけにはいかないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Things never go exactly according to plan when Apexi are involved."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Captain"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "船長！\u3000船底が破損してます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Captain! The hull's been damaged!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船員Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crew Member A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すぐ修理しましょう！\nミミちゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's repair it right away! Mimi!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、手伝うわ。道具の用意は抜かりないものね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, I'll help. I made sure to bring all the tools we need."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "海の中から引きずり出さないことには\nこちらも攻められないね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We won't be able to attack effectively unless we can drag it out of the water."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうですね……何か手を考えないと。\n邪知に長けた相手の、上をいかねば！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're right... We need to think of something. We have to outsmart this cunning creature!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ。あなたはこのまま果ての大陸を目指せば\nいいの。私も応援しちゃうわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, you should keep pursuing your path to World's End. You'll have my full support."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（たとえ師匠の庇護が無くても……やり遂げてみせる）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even without Miss Saskia's protection... I'll see this through to the end.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
